# Agate-Blade Assassin: "defending player", not "each opponent" (CR 508.5). In a three-player game Bot1 attacks Bot2 with the Assassin: Bot2 loses
# 1 to the trigger and 1 to combat damage (18), Bot1 gains 1 (21), and Bot3 loses nothing (20).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Agate-Blade Assassin
Swamp x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Bot3 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Agate-Blade Assassin.Cast
[T4 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
Bot1.Attack(Agate-Blade Assassin > Bot2)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot3.Pass
? Bot2.Life = 19
? Bot3.Life = 20
[T4 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 18
Bot3.Life = 20
Bot1.Life = 21
